cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study or its scripts, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "claude-context-budget: where one month of Claude Code tokens went"
abstract: >-
  A measured study of one person's Claude Code token usage over one month
  (39,275 API calls), with stdlib-only Python scripts that read local logs,
  price the calls at API list prices and estimate what a context cap would save.
authors:
